  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  questionText:
  - language: English
    text: Which statement about the occurrence of D- and L-amino acids is correct?
  - language: German
    text: "Welche Aussage \xFCber das Vorkommen von D- und L-Aminos\xE4uren in der
      Natur ist korrekt?"
  answers:
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: In proteins of living organisms, almost only L-amino acids occur.
    - language: German
      text: "In Proteinen lebender Organismen kommen fast ausschlie\xDFlich L-Aminos\xE4uren
        vor."
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: D-amino acids are the building blocks of all proteins.
    - language: German
      text: "D-Aminos\xE4uren sind die Bausteine aller Proteine."
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: D-amino acids are completely unknown in nature.
    - language: German
      text: "D-Aminos\xE4uren sind in der Natur v\xF6llig unbekannt."
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Both forms occur in equal amounts in proteins.
    - language: German
      text: Beide Formen werden in gleicher Menge in Proteinen eingebaut.
  correctAnswer: 1
